        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The mounts trample anything they can knock down. Creatures that are Medium or smaller, and troops without mounts, take a -1 status penalty to their saves against the troop's Battle attack; this penalty increases to -2 at 15th level.</p><p>The mounts are hard to rein in: the troop takes a -1 status penalty on Reflex saves against area effects and on Will saves against mental effects. Both penalties end at 10th level.</p>"
        },
